  "task": {
    "instructions": "Read the image file `input/figure.jpg` to answer the following multiple-choice question.\n\nIn panel D, for how many of the steps was the response to stimulus greater in the ASAP2f R414Q than the ASAP2f L146G S147T R414Q?\n\nOptions:\n{options}\n\nWrite your answer (the number) to `output/answer.txt`.\n\nYou have up to 20 minutes (1200 seconds). Do not use online solutions or hints specific to this task.\n"
  },
